The Keiser M Series simulator uses published Keiser developer documentation
and the phase's archived capture fixtures. Keiser Corporation's MIT-licensed
M3i BLE-HCI simulator was a test reference, not code incorporated here.

The Sole simulator replays user-supplied BLE captures. The fixtures identify
the source capture, connection and SHA-256. Persona implementation and fixture
payloads are independent of QDomyos-Zwift source code.

See the repository's LICENSE, NOTICE, and Stage 3 provenance record.
